  "source_note": "<!-- zh -->\n漫画分镜。排版：杂志编辑式，大标题、人物、说明文字和漫画格共同参与页面构成。让该分镜机制决定页面结构、阅读顺序、主次画格和镜头节奏；输出一张完整单页漫画页面，画格共同讲述连续情节，角色外观在各格保持一致。\n\n<!-- en -->\nComic storyboard. Layout: Editorial Magazine Layout, bold headlines, character cutouts, captions, and narrative panels composed like high-end editorial spread. Let this storyboard mechanism determine the page structure, reading flow, panel hierarchy, and pacing; output a complete single-page comic where panels tell a continuous story with consistent characters.\n",
